{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/8984/", "pk": 8984, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/", "pk": 226, "shortname": "diveoahu", "name": "Dive Oahu", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Shallow Reefs Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 4, "unicode": "Shallow Reefs Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 5000, "description": "#INTRODUCTORY DIVING\n\n##Duration\n3-4 Hours\n\n##About\n\n*Never been diving before? Check out our **PADI Discover Scuba Diving Experience** for non-certified introductory divers.* Introductory Divers will receive a 1-on-1 skills session, that will provide basic safety guidelines and skills needed to dive under the direct supervision of a PADI Professional, followed by a guided reef tour! Enjoy exceptional diving along Hawaii's famous reefs! \n\n#CERTIFIED DIVING\n\nEnjoy exceptional diving along Honolulu's famous reefs such as **Kaiser's, Turtle Canyons** and **Secrets**! Perfect for experienced divers who want a leisurely guided tour of Hawaii's reefs or divers who want to polish off those rusty skills. This will be a two tank dive excursion with dives between 25-50' depending on the reef and dive plan. *Haven't gone diving in a while? Call ahead to book our **PADI Reactivate Program** to refresh those dive skills on this tour!*\n\n#SNORKELING\nCome aboard with Dive Oahu for a snorkeling tour with turtles. Snorkel along side turtles and spot Hawaii's diverse array of tropical fish. Our guides will be in the water to point out all the exciting wildlife for you to see!\n\n#RIDE ALONG\nHave family or friends that just want to ride along? Bring them!\n\n**Enjoy sights such as**:\n* Critically endangered Honu, Hawaii's Green Sea Turtle at fish cleaning stations. \n* Abundant fish, over 21% of the fish you might see are found nowhere else in the world. \n* Dolphins frolicking nearby\n* Humpback whales in the winter. \n\n**This dive includes:** \n• In-Water Guide\n• All premium gear needed\n• Light snack with refreshments\n\n**Want photos or videos of your snorkel experience? Rent a GoPro or hire a photographer for additional pricing.**\n\n**_NOT_ Included:** \n• Gratuity for crew\n• Reef Safe Sunscreen\n• Swimwear\n• Towel \n\n*PADI standards do not allow introductory divers to use any form of camera equipment including hands free cameras like 'GoPros' while diving, as your safety is the primary concern.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "***You can NOT fly for 24 hours after diving***\n***You must be at the harbor 30 minutes prior to check in***\n\nIf you are a ***non-certified diver*** (Discover Scuba Diver or Student Diver):\nPlease review [View Diver Medical](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/COj3pMHSThKTtbRU1AIe)  (no need to print) If you answer 'yes' to any portion of the medical questionnaire, please bring a copy of the Medical Statement signed by a doctor.\n\n **CANCELLATIONS DUE TO THE ABSENCE OF REQUIRED MEDICAL STATEMENT/PHYSICIANS RELEASE AFTER THE CANCELLAION PERIOD FORFEIT ANY REIMBURSEMENT.**\n                                      \n**Trip Protection**\nMake sure what happens on land doesn't impact your underwater time! Protect yourself with trip protection so you can cancel your tour anytime and for any reason for a full refund less the cost of trip protection and fees! (90% refunded)\n\nLooking for something extra to add on to your charter? Please give us a call at **(808) 922 - 3483** to ask our staff about the following options: \n- Private Guide\n- Photographer \n- Camera Rental  *(GoPro or SeaLife Camera Housing)*\n\n***Cameras** - For safety and adherence to PADI Standards, Discover Scuba Divers and Student Divers are **unable** to utilize underwater cameras (this includes GoPros). If you are a Discover Scuba Diver or Student Diver and would like photos or videos of your dive experience, please contact our shop and we can arrange a photographer for you.  \n\n***FOR ALL UNACCOMPANIED MINORS _(Ages 15 and up)_:**\n**CERTIFIED** - Parent/Guardian must sign the Dive Oahu waiver electronically prior to arrival. \n\nParent or Guardian must also sign off on the Discovery Scuba Diver eLearning. To complete this paperwork please follow the steps above. Parent or Guardian must accompany Diver on the boat as a rider or diver.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "3-4 Hours • Ages 8+", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/8984/images/227937/", "pk": 227937, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vzudqlKpQOyuuV8myDDX", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vzudqlKpQOyuuV8myDDX", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/diveoahu/items/8984/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vzudqlKpQOyuuV8myDDX", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/vzudqlKpQOyuuV8myDDX", "is_low_resolu